Subject: [PATCH] Windows Emergency CARE + CARE Bill Desk UI parity

Adapt the DS225+ capture stack for Windows Docker Desktop and match the
CARE ERP Billing Desk layout so reception staff use the same visual workflow.

- Light Bill Desk UI: Patient / Doctor / Investigations + Selected / Summary / Payment
- Obvious EMERGENCY MODE banner and Main CARE online/offline status (grace period)
- Sync From Main CARE / Push Emergency Data / Retry Failed / CSV+backup ops panel
- PRIMARY_CARE_URL pull/push via CARE /api/emergency-bridge contract
- Windows compose override, .env.windows.example, Start/Backup/Restore scripts
- Persist sync_status metadata; copy backup.sh into API image
